It is a Rust/Candle port and reimplementation of work by others:

- MelBandRoformer model code: Music-Source-Separation-Training
  https://github.com/ZFTurbo/Music-Source-Separation-Training
  MIT, Copyright 2024 Roman Solovyev.

- Rotary embeddings (as used by the model): lucidrains/rotary-embedding-torch
  https://github.com/lucidrains/rotary-embedding-torch
  MIT.

- Separation model lineage and inference conventions: Ultimate Vocal Remover
  https://github.com/Anjok07/ultimatevocalremovergui
  MIT.

- Whisper transcription layer and mel filter banks: OpenAI Whisper
  https://github.com/openai/whisper
  MIT, Copyright 2022 OpenAI.

- Whisper model plumbing follows the Candle example
  https://github.com/huggingface/candle
  MIT OR Apache-2.0, Copyright 2023-2024 Hugging Face.

Pinned revisions, file hashes and the licence audit for dependencies are kept
in the repository (docs/provenance, docs/dependency-audit.md). Model weights
